# MODEL-G-006: drctest; spacing m1 m1 3: two spacing violations whose error regions are L-shaped; drc count, drc listall why and the error tiles of the saved cell.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load a
box 0 0 10 10
paint m1
box 12 0 20 12
paint m1
box 0 12 20 20
paint m1
box 40 0 50 10
paint m1
box 52 0 60 12
paint m1
box 40 12 60 20
paint m1
select top cell
drc check
drc catchup
drc count
drc listall why
drc list count total
save a
